working_notes/iteration_summaries.md:305:Recorded the prefix-compatibility modulus \(\kappa_I(\mathcal U)\) as a promising local LP/duality object. It recovers the two-threshold coefficient on zero blocks, but still needs finite-grid duality, strict-threshold cleanup, outside-surplus accounting, and rare-event probability weighting.
working_notes/iteration_summaries.md:320:2. Prove finite-grid \(\kappa\) duality and the two-threshold formula rigorously.
